<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DeKalb Genetics cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DeKalb Genetics cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded DeKalb Genetics Corp to intermediate-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said maintained DeKalb as long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- DeKalb gained 1/2 to 81-3/4.</p>
</text>
